<section class="hero">
<h1>bend-kit</h1>
<p>A general-purpose library for <a href="https://bend-lang.com">Bend 2</a>, in {{count}} packages. Each package is proved against its own laws and timed against C, Rust, Python, and JavaScript.</p>
<p>Import a package from the Bend hub by name and version. Agents can read <a href="{{base}}/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>.</p>
</section>
<table class="catalog">
<thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#packages}}
<tr><td><a href="{{base}}/packages/{{name}}/">{{name}}</a><br><code class="version">{{version}}</code></td><td>{{about}}<br><code class="import">import bend-kit-{{name}}@{{version}}/{{name}}.bend</code></td></tr>
{{/packages}}
</tbody>
</table>
